# The Stair of Hours (CIPlay stair_of_hours): a sky island 30 m up; the hours walked (1, 3, 7 - then 12 shows), the
# sundial instructions, the telescope (the vault opens), the vault's three plans, Halvard's last log.
island The Stair of Hours
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Walking the Hours
zone hour_1
expect step 1
read Sundial instructions
expect step 2
zone hour_3
zone hour_7
zone hour_12
expect step 3
use telescope
expect story sighted 1
expect step 4
open Telescope vault
wait 3
expect step 7
read Halvard's last log
storespot 0 -18
expect done
